OL,3,A'Half my business will be gone' - firms
OL,4,Ain Canada and US fear trade war
OL,5,
OL,6,FCindy Baldassi relies on American
OL,7,Fbuyers to keep her stone-and-glass
OL,8,Fjewellery company going.
OL,10,FSome 75% of sales of pieces including
OL,11,Famethyst, sea glass and agates from her
OL,12,Fbusiness, CindyLouWho2, based in
OL,13,FCalgary, Alberta, come from Americans.
OL,15,FBut after trade talks between the US
OL,16,Fand Canada collapsed over the weekend
OL,17,Fand leaders of both countries pledged
OL,18,Fto slap 50% tariffs on each other's
OL,19,Fproducts, business owners on both sides
OL,20,Fof the border are bracing for the
OL,21,Ffallout.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,115,105,200,300,0,100
