OL,3,A'Half my business will be gone' - firms
OL,4,Ain Canada and US fear trade war
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith a majority of the items she sells
OL,7,Ffalling under US President Donald
OL,8,FTrump's newly imposed tariffs, Baldassi
OL,9,Fsays she will need to add 50% to the
OL,10,Fprice of most of her products to stay
OL,11,Fafloat.
